    "name": "Party Friends",
    "steam_appid": 1791230,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1791230/extras/412d2fa3c36041268377a0473a611c44.avif?t=1664236281\" /></div><br><br>&quot;Party Friends is a mini-game collection. <br>Play games like Fall Tower, Parcour, Live or Die or Prop Hunt. <br>Play against up to 16 players. In future updates Party Friends will of course be expanded with more minigames. <br>The game mode &quot;Last Friend Standing&quot; will also find its way into the game. <br>Communicate with other players via Chat or Voice.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1791230/extras/cf70b1df7e9feaf5e029df0f17fcd252.avif?t=1664236281\" /></div><br><br>At this stage there are 5 different mini-games<br>These include Prop Hunt, Fall Tower, Parcour, Live or Die and Infected.<br>In the future, classics like Red Light/Green Light or Hide and Seek will be added.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1791230/extras/509ed56df556f9df8a73a290cb61f63b.avif?t=1664236281\" /></div><br><br>We want to ensure replay value, of course. That's why we are trying hard to add several mini-games to Party Friends. We are already working on the well-known Last Man Standing game mode. In which it is a matter of running through several mini-games until there is only one surviving player. <br><br>Also in future updates there will be character costumes like hats, shirts or pants to make your character unique.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1791230/extras/412d2fa3c36041268377a0473a611c44.avif?t=1664236281\" /></div><br><br>&quot;Party Friends is a mini-game collection. <br>Play games like Fall Tower, Parcour, Live or Die or Prop Hunt. <br>Play against up to 16 players. In future updates Party Friends will of course be expanded with more minigames. <br>The game mode &quot;Last Friend Standing&quot; will also find its way into the game. <br>Communicate with other players via Chat or Voice.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1791230/extras/cf70b1df7e9feaf5e029df0f17fcd252.avif?t=1664236281\" /></div><br><br>At this stage there are 5 different mini-games<br>These include Prop Hunt, Fall Tower, Parcour, Live or Die and Infected.<br>In the future, classics like Red Light/Green Light or Hide and Seek will be added.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1791230/extras/509ed56df556f9df8a73a290cb61f63b.avif?t=1664236281\" /></div><br><br>We want to ensure replay value, of course. That's why we are trying hard to add several mini-games to Party Friends. We are already working on the well-known Last Man Standing game mode. In which it is a matter of running through several mini-games until there is only one surviving player. <br><br>Also in future updates there will be character costumes like hats, shirts or pants to make your character unique.",
    "short_description": "Play minigames like Parkour, Prophunt, Fall Tower or other games with up to 16 players. And way more to come!",
